<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F5.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S6.F5.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8-bit AppMults.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 5: </span>Trade-off between VGG19 accuracy and power consumption using 7-bit and 8-bit AppMults on the CIFAR-10 dataset. Power is normalized to that of the 8-bit AccMult (mul8u_acc).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S6.F6" class="ltx_figure">
